    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural extension of my analytical mind—something I can engage deeply without much hesitation, especially in art where precise forms and logic play a role. My vocational training required practical calculations, which sharpened my comfort. It’s both frustrating when stuck but rewarding when solved, much like baking combining creativity with precision.",
